'''Li'l Flying Cat'''  (天空のちびネコ, ''Tenkū no Chibi Neko'', '''Chibi Sky Cat''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy first found in [[Tiny Wings (Deadly)|Li'l Bird Awakens!]] It was added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Li'l Flying Cat
|image = E 327.png
|appearance = [[Tiny Wings (Deadly)|Li'l Bird Awakens!]]
[[Path to +50|Li'l Cat's Trial]]
|money drop = 1,999¢ - 7,896¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy is as hard as his [[Manic Flying Cat (Enemy)|Manic counterpart]] to defeat, having enormous range, health, damage, and only one knockback. It still keeps the floating trait and isn't as durable, however.

